  "idea": "Webflow localization update for multi-region landing pages",
  "text": "You can now translate and localize entire marketing sites without duplicating page trees. Expanding an e-commerce brand into international markets usually requires custom subdomains, third-party translation widgets, and disjointed styling. Bulky third-party translation scripts slow down page speed and ruin international mobile conversion rates. Webflow Localization serves static localized pages with native hreflang tags and machine translation built right into the CMS. You capture global revenue without performance trade-offs.",
